<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 75 0 R
/E (I am a self-taught visual artist and curator passionate about exploring minimalist or abstract figurative and modern African art. My work focuses on African spirituality, women's stories and Zambian history, and I enjoy creating pieces that engage viewers personally and emotionally.l level. Beyond my artistic endeavours, I am also a passionate advocate for cultural preservation and education. As I continue my journey as an aspiring artist, I remain guided by my unwavering love for Zambia and I am determined to leave a lasting legacy, honouring its rich cultural tapestry.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
